-county"],["ARC or PLC in Bear Lake County","/arc-plc/idaho/bear-lake-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, July to August is the driest pair on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids, and it came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years since 1951. In 2025, June to July landed at 15% of normal on the middle of the grids. In 2026 so far, May to June sits at 55% of normal there. Grid 26476 had its driest year in 1988 at 56% of normal.</p>"}
